    "sachet_system_1_MyKJDg": {
      "type": "sachet-system-1",
      "blocks": {
        "row_yfNccY": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Dedicated_to_Sustainability.png",
            "label": "",
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>At Clenli Direct, we are not just pioneers in powerful robotic cleaning, we're dedicated to sustainability too.</p><p> </p><p>Our partnership with LionsBot International underscores our commitment to reducing environmental footprints through design and function, and through charitable collaborations with environmental and humanitarian organizations.</p><p> </p><p>Here's how our robotic cleaning solutions drive sustainability:</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_g9cURx": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Less_Energy_More_Cleaning.png",
            "label": "",
            "heading": "Less Energy for More Cleaning",
            "text": "<p>LionsBot's Rex is an energy-efficient powerhouse, revolutionizing the cleaning industry with its impressive capabilities. On a single charge, Rex can operate for up to 6 continuous hours, delivering exceptional cleaning performance at a rate of up to 2,500 m² per hour. This means that in just one charge, Rex can clean an astonishing 15,000 m², making it an ideal solution for large commercial spaces, warehouses, and expansive office buildings. Its efficiency not only saves time but also reduces operational costs, ensuring a spotless environment with minimal energy consumption.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_hbDh3y": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Not_One_Drop_of_Water_Wasted_ed24fdea-83ca-48fd-8c94-4cb0c1393aa6.png",
            "label": "",
            "heading": "Not One Drop of Water Wasted",
            "text": "<p>The R3 Scrub Pro is engineered to use 85% less water (6L/hr) than traditional scrubbers, making it a highly efficient and eco-friendly option. This water-saving innovation sets the LionsBot range apart, offering superior cleaning performance while conserving resources and reducing operational costs.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
